BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvassing Training
DTSTART:20260716T213000Z
DTEND:20260716T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260715T073110Z
UID:0679cc4a-9e03-5201-9673-f38d72d30012
DESCRIPTION:Learn about Cycle Toronto Summer Cycling Campaigns and how to 
 canvas! We will give a presentation of everything we are working on\, have
  time to practice canvassing conversations\, and show you how to sign up f
 or future shifts.\n\nSome snacks will be provided.\nURL: https://www.cycle
 to.ca/canvassing_training_20260716
LOCATION:AccessPoint on Danforth (APOD)\, Community Room 6\n3079 Danforth 
 Avenue\nToronto ON M1L 1A8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/canvassing_training_20260716
END:VEVENT
