DTEND:20260722T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260715T073108Z
UID:3d75c5e7-7e94-5c67-a716-76a5612a97e2
DESCRIPTION:(https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub)\n\nThe Cycle Toronto Rec Hub 
 at Evergreen Brick Works is a welcoming community space that takes the int
 imidation out of bike maintenance and repair.\n\nIF YOU'RE ALREADY A TRAIN
 ED CYCLE TORONTO REC HUB VOLUNTEER\, SIGN UP FOR SUPPORT SHIFTS.\n\nOur fr
 iendly staff and volunteers will help guide you through the basics to keep
  you rolling. Even expert home mechanics are also welcome to use our facil
 ities.\n\nDIY service is first come\, first serve.\n\nFind out more: (http
 s://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub) cycleto.ca/rec_hub\nURL: https://www.cycleto.c
 a/rec_hub_diy_20260722
LOCATION:Rec Hub at Evergreen Brick Works\n550 Bayview Avenue\nToronto ON 
 M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/rec_hub_diy_20260722
END:VEVENT
